          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"4-evaluation\">4 \u00b7 Evaluation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Held-out test docs are corrupted with a fixed seed, every model re-predicts all\ngaps, and we score: per-class F1, break detection, segmentation quality\n(Pk / WindowDiff, lower = better), text similarity, and throughput.\nBaselines (<code>majority</code>, <code>rules</code>) show what the learned models actually buy.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
